/T (The Student Skill Portfolio Website project successfully demonstrated collaborative  software development using Git and GitHub. By dividing the project into separate modules and following a structured branching strategy, the team was able to work efficiently and integrate all features through Pull Requests. The project strengthened our understanding of version control, collaborative development, responsive web design, and deployment using GitHub Pages. Overall, it provided valuable practical experience that reflects real-world software development practices. )
